    <briefdescription>
<para>A wrapper predicate designed for use with std::remove_if. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This predicate wraps a predicate suitable for use with std::remove_if to call M.erase(x) on each element which is slated for removal. This just allows the predicate to be move only which we can&apos;t do with lambdas today. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
